# third_party repos
third_party/*
!third_party/
!third_party/README.md
!third_party/examples/
!third_party/examples/**

base_ws/src/dump/

# third_party2/livox-SDK 빌드 에러 생겨서 그냥 저기서 빌드했음. 크게 신경쓸 건 아닐 듯.
build_external/

# map files
# kcity_map/

docs/external_docs/
docs/local_notes.md
artifacts/mvp_validation/

### 아래는 ros catkin 관련.

